# Prettier scope: workspace source (packages/*/src) + root config files.
# Everything below is intentionally out of prettier's reach so that
# `pnpm format:check` is green and `pnpm format` never rewrites generated
# output, the prototype footprint, the docs corpus, or the lockfile.

# Dependencies & build output (generated)
node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
coverage/

# Package manager (pnpm owns the lockfile's format)
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Hand-authored manifests kept in their compact, tool-native shape
package.json
**/package.json
pnpm-workspace.yaml

# Prototype footprint (temporary tenant — removed at migration; see docs/migration.md)
.co/
.claude/
.codex/
.goals/
.research/
PORTING-CO.md
PRINCIPLES.md

# Review-harness scratch (injected into a reviewer's worktree during review; never committed)
REVIEW_*.md
REVIEW_*.json

# Docs corpus (authored prose, including the migrated design corpus — not prettier-managed)
docs/

# GitHub config (issue/PR templates, labels — GitHub's domain, kept as authored)
.github/
